 moyenne","accepted_translations":["moyenne","moyen"],"ipa":"/ˈævərɪdʒ/","romanization":null,"emoji":null,"example_en":"The average family has fewer than two children.","example_es":"La famille moyenne a moins de deux enfants.","difficulty":1,"tags":["society","numbers"]},{"id":"efr-survey","language_code":"en","unit_id":"efr-b2-u03","text":"survey","translation_es":"sondage / enquête","accepted_translations":["sondage","enquête"],"ipa":"/ˈsɜrveɪ/","romanization":null,"emoji":"📋","example_en":"According to a survey, most people are happy.","example_es":"D’après un sondage, la plupart des gens sont heureux.","difficulty":1,"tags":["society","numbers"]},{"id":"efr-rise","language_code":"en","unit_id":"efr-b2-u03","text":"rise","translation_es":"augmenter / monter","accepted_translations":["augmenter","monter","être en hausse"],"ipa":"/raɪz/","romanization":null,"emoji":"⬆️","example_en":"Prices have risen a lot this year.","example_es":"Les prix ont beaucoup augmenté cette année.","difficulty":1,"tags":["numbers","verbs"]},{"id":"efr-decline","language_code":"en","unit_id":"efr-b2-u03","text":"decline","translation_es":"diminuer / baisser","accepted_translations":["diminuer","baisser","reculer"],"ipa":"/dɪˈklaɪn/","romanization":null,"emoji":"⬇️","example_en":"The number of large families has declined.","example_es":"Le nombre de familles nombreuses a diminué.","difficulty":1,"tags":["numbers","verbs"]},{"id":"efr-it-is-said","language_code":"en","unit_id":"efr-b2-u03","text":"it is said that","translation_es":"on dit que","accepted_translations":["il paraît que"],"ipa":"/ɪt ɪz ˈsɛd ðæt/","romanization":null,"emoji":null,"example_en":"It is said that the house is two hundred years old.","example_es":"On dit que la maison a deux cents ans.","difficulty":1,"tags":["passive"]},{"id":"efr-be-expected-to","language_code":"en","unit_id":"efr-b2-u03","text":"be expected to","translation_es":"on s’attend à ce que / devoir (selon les prévisions)","accepted_translations":["on p