 la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Sorry, I didn't ___ to wake you up.","translation":"Pardon, je ne voulais pas te réveiller.","options":["mean","want","try","think"]},"answer":"mean","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Didn’t mean to + verbe : tu n’avais pas l’intention de le faire.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-mean-to"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u01-final-e03","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u01-final","position":3,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"apparently","options":["apparently","seem","get across","tend to"]},"answer":"apparently","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-apparently"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u01-final-e04","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u01-final","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"We were tired, so we stopped ___ a coffee.","translation":"On était fatigués, alors on s’est arrêtés pour prendre un café.","options":["to have","having","have","had"]},"answer":"to have","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Stop + to : s’arrêter pour faire autre chose. Stop + -ing : arrêter de le faire.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-remember-doing"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u01-final-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u01-final","position":5,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Réponds en anglais","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Was he being serious? (non, il était sarcastique)","translation":"Il était sérieux ?"},"answer":"No, he was being sarcastic.","accepted_answers":["He was being sarcastic.","No, he was sarcastic.","No. He was being sarcastic."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["efr-sarcastic"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u01-final-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u01-final","position":6,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_e