r.stim.b2-u3-alone","document":"post","setting":"Un article sur un sondage consacré aux personnes qui vivent seules.","title":"A table for one","lines":["Living alone used to be unusual. Today it is one of the biggest trends in our society.","According to a recent survey, one in four homes now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten.","The majority of people who live alone are over sixty, but the number of young people living alone is also rising.","It is often said that living alone makes people lonely. However, the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy with their lives.","What has declined is the number of large families. In 1970 the average family had four children. Today it has fewer than two."]},"question":"Comment le nombre de foyers d’une seule personne a-t-il évolué ?","options":["Il est passé d’un sur dix à un sur quatre","Il est passé d’un sur quatre à un sur dix","Il n’a pas changé","Il a baissé de moitié"]},"answer":"Il est passé d’un sur dix à un sur quatre","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article dit : « one in four homes now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u03-l02-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u03-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u3-alone","document":"post","setting":"Un article sur un sondage consacré aux personnes qui vivent seules.","title":"A table for one","lines":["Living alone used to be unusual. Today it is one of the biggest trends in our society.","According to a recent survey, one in four homes now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten.","The majority of people who live alone are over sixty, but the number of young people living alone is also rising.","It is often said that living alone makes people lonely. However, the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy with their lives.","What has declined is the number of large families. In 1970 the average family had four children. Today it has fewer than two."]},"question":"Que dit le sondage sur l’idée que vivre seul rend solitaire ?","options":["Que la plupart des gens qui vivent seuls se disent heureux","Qu’elle est vraie","Qu’elle ne vaut que pour les jeunes","Qu’il n’a pas posé la question"]},"answer":"Que la plupart des gens qui vivent seuls se disent heureux","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article dit : « the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u03-l02-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u03-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u3-alone","document":"post","setting":"Un article sur un sondage consacré aux personnes qui vivent seules.","title":"A table for one","lines":["Living alone used to be unusual. Today it is one of the biggest trends in our society.","According to a recent survey, one in four homes now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten.","The majority of people who live alone are over sixty, but the number of young people living alone is also rising.","It is often said that living alone makes people lonely. However, the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy with their lives.","What has declined is the number of large families. In 1970 the average family had four children. Today it has fewer than two."]},"question":"D’après l’article, qu’est-ce qui a diminué ?","options":["Le nombre de familles nombreuses","Le nombre de personnes âgées","Le nombre de foyers","Le nombre de jeunes"]},"answer":"Le nombre de familles nombreuses","accepted_answers":[],"