oice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"My guest today is Dr. Mei Lin, whose team has come up with a new way to clean water. Welcome."},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Thank you. Our filter, which costs less than five dollars, uses only sunlight to clean dirty water."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"That sounds like a real breakthrough. How did you get the idea?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed, which was very frustrating at the time. But the results showed something we didn't expect."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is there evidence that it works outside the lab?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Yes. We have tested it in forty villages, most of which have no clean water. The data are very clear."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What is the next step?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"We want to make it in large numbers. The invention is useless if the people who need it can't get it."}]},"question":"Comment l’idée du filtre est-elle née ?","options":["Par hasard, à partir d’une expérience ratée","Après des années de préparation","Grâce à un autre scientifique","Pendant un voyage dans un village"]},"answer":"Par hasard, à partir d’une expérience ratée","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mei dit : « By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed… But the results showed something we didn’t expect ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u04-l01-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u04-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u4-interview","setting":"Une interview à la radio d’une scientifique qui a inventé un filtre à eau.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mei","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"My guest today is Dr. Mei Lin, whose team has come up with a new way to clean water. Welcome."},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Thank you. Our filter, which costs less than five dollars, uses only sunlight to clean dirty water."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"That sounds like a real breakthrough. How did you get the idea?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed, which was very frustrating at the time. But the results showed something we didn't expect."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is there evidence that it works outside the lab?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Yes. We have tested it in forty villages, most of which have no clean water. The data are very clear."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What is the next step?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"We want to make it in large numbers. The invention is useless if the people who need it can't get it."}]},"question":"Quelles preuves ont-ils que le filtre marche hors du laboratoire ?","options":["Ils l’ont testé dans quarante villages et les données sont claires","Aucune pour l’instant","Ils l’ont testé dans leur ville","On l’utilise dans des hôpitaux"]},"answer":"Ils l’ont testé dans quarante villages et les données sont claires","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mei dit : « We have tested it in forty villages… The data are very clear ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u04-l01-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u04-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","options":["The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","The experiment worked, and we learned a lot.","The experiment failed, but we learned nothing.","The experiments failed, but we learned a lot."]},"answer":"The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-experiment"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u04-l01-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u04-l01","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Remet