d costs half the price.","Third, before buying anything, I ask myself one question: is this good value for money, or do I just want it?","One year later, I have saved three thousand dollars. It was by far the best decision I made last year."]},"question":"Quelle question se pose-t-elle avant d’acheter quelque chose ?","options":["Si ça vaut son prix ou si elle en a juste envie","Si c’est d’une bonne marque","Si elle peut payer en plusieurs fois","Si c’est à la mode"]},"answer":"Si ça vaut son prix ou si elle en a juste envie","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Elle écrit : « is this good value for money, or do I just want it? ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u05-l02-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u05-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u5-savings","document":"post","setting":"Un article de blog sur comment économiser.","title":"How I saved $3,000 in a year","lines":["Last January I looked at my bank account and realized I had no savings at all. So I decided to change a few things.","First, I cut back on subscriptions. I was paying for four streaming services and a gym I never went to. Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month.","Second, I started buying second-hand clothes and furniture. Most of it is in perfect condition and costs half the price.","Third, before buying anything, I ask myself one question: is this good value for money, or do I just want it?","One year later, I have saved three thousand dollars. It was by far the best decision I made last year."]},"question":"Que pense-t-elle des vêtements et des meubles d’occasion ?","options":["Presque tout est en parfait état et coûte moitié prix","Qu’ils sont de mauvaise qualité","Qu’ils sont chers","Qu’elle ne les recommande pas"]},"answer":"Presque tout est en parfait état et coûte moitié prix","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Elle 