_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u5-reviews","document":"post","setting":"Deux avis de clients sur un casque audio dans une boutique en ligne.","title":"Customer reviews","lines":["★★★★★ \"A real bargain.\" I bought these on sale for thirty dollars. They are nowhere near as famous as the big brands, but the sound is just as good. Great value for money.","★☆☆☆☆ \"Total rip-off.\" I paid two hundred dollars because of the brand name, and they broke after a month. The more you pay, the better the quality? Not here. Completely overpriced.","Reply from the shop: We are sorry to hear this. Please send us your receipt and we will have the headphones repaired or replaced."]},"question":"Pourquoi le premier client est-il content ?","options":["Il l’a payé peu cher et le son est aussi bon que celui des grandes marques","C’est une marque célèbre","On le lui a offert","On l’a remboursé"]},"answer":"Il l’a payé peu cher et le son est aussi bon que celui des grandes marques","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Il écrit : « They are nowhere near as famous as the big brands, but the sound is just as good ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u05-l05-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u05-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u5-reviews","document":"post","setting":"Deux avis de clients sur un casque audio dans une boutique en ligne.","title":"Customer reviews","lines":["★★★★★ \"A real bargain.\" I bought these on sale for thirty dollars. They are nowhere near as famous as the big brands, but the sound is just as good. Great value for money.","★☆☆☆☆ \"Total rip-off.\" I paid two hundred dollars because of the brand name, and they broke after a month. The more you pay, the better the quality? Not here. Completely overpriced.","Reply from the shop: We are sorry to hear this. Please send us your receipt and we will have the headphones repaired or replaced."]},"question":"Que critique le deuxième client ?","options":["Qu’il a payé cher pour la marque et que le casque s’est cassé au bout d’un mois","Qu’il n’était pas cher","Qu’il a mis du temps à arriver","Qu’il n’avait pas de marque"]},"answer":"Qu’il a payé cher pour la marque et que le casque s’est cassé au bout d’un mois","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Il écrit : « I paid two hundred dollars because of the brand name, and they broke after a month… Completely overpriced ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u05-l05-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u05-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Ten dollars for a coffee? What a rip-off!","options":["Ten dollars for a coffee? What a rip-off!","Two dollars for a coffee? What a bargain!","Ten dollars for a coffee? What a bargain!","Ten dollars for a cake? What a rip-off!"]},"answer":"Ten dollars for a coffee? What a rip-off!","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-rip-off"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u05-l05-e08","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u05-l05","position":8,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u5-reviews","document":"post","setting":"Deux avis de clients sur un casque audio dans une boutique en ligne.","title":"Customer reviews","lines":["★★★★★ \"A real bargain.\" I bought these on sale for thirty dollars. They are nowhere near as famous as the big brands, but the sound is just as good. Great value for money.","★☆☆☆☆ \"Total rip-off.\" I paid two hundred dollars because of the brand name, and they broke after a month. The more you pay, the better the quality? Not here. Completely overpriced.","Reply from the shop: We are sorry to hear this. Please send us your receipt a