ulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u06-l02-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u06-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u6-no-answer","setting":"Deux amis s’inquiètent parce qu’une amie ne répond pas.","speakers":[{"name":"Max","voice":"a"},{"name":"Eva","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Max","text":"Sara hasn't answered my messages since Friday. That's not like her."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"She must have lost her phone again. She loses it every month."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"She can't have lost it. She posted a photo on social media this morning."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"Then she might have been busy with work. She has a big project at the moment."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"Maybe. Or I might have said something that upset her. I made a joke about her new job."},{"speaker":"Eva","text":"Honestly, you shouldn't have joked about that. She's very nervous about it."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"You're right. I should have thought before I spoke. I'll call her tonight and apologize."}]},"question":"Que regrette Max et que va-t-il faire ?","options":["Ne pas avoir réfléchi avant de parler ; il va l’appeler pour s’excuser","Avoir appelé tard ; il va lui écrire","Avoir perdu son téléphone ; il va en acheter un autre","Rien ; il va attendre"]},"answer":"Ne pas avoir réfléchi avant de parler ; il va l’appeler pour s’excuser","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Max dit : « I should have thought before I spoke. I’ll call her tonight and apologize ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u06-l02-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u06-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"You could have told me earlier!","options":["You could have told me earlier!","You should have told me e