’article dit : « Whereas a single family can save a few tons of CO2 a year, one large factory can produce millions ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u07-l01-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u07-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Global warming is changing the weather.","options":["Global warming is changing the weather.","Global warming is changing the world.","Global warming has changed the weather.","Pollution is changing the weather."]},"answer":"Global warming is changing the weather.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-global-warming"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u07-l01-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u07-l01","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Remets les mots dans l’ordre","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Cars","produce","a","lot","of","emissions"],"translation":"Les voitures produisent beaucoup d’émissions."},"answer":"Cars produce a lot of emissions.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["efr-emissions"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u07-l01-e08","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u07-l01","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Réponds en anglais","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"How can you reduce your carbon footprint? (manger moins de viande)","translation":"Comment peux-tu réduire ton empreinte carbone ?"},"answer":"I can eat less meat.","accepted_answers":["By eating less meat.","Eat less meat.","I can reduce it by eating less meat."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["efr-carbon-footprint"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u07-l01-e09","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u07-l01","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduis en anglais","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Le réchauffement cl