+ verbe.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-deny","efr-rumor"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u08-l05-e04","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u08-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Un article d’un journal local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"Qu’a admis la maire ?","options":["Que la ville avait parlé de nouveaux bureaux dans le quartier","Qu’on allait fermer le parc","Que la publication disait vrai","Qu’elle ne connaissait pas le projet"]},"answer":"Que la ville avait parlé de nouveaux bureaux dans le quartier","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article dit : « She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u08-l05-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u08-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Un article d’un journal local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"Qu’a fait la personne qui a créé la publication ?","options":["Elle a refusé de faire des commentaires","Elle s’est excusée","Elle a supprimé la publication","Elle a parlé avec la maire"]},"answer":"Elle a refusé de faire des commentaires","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article se termine ainsi : « The person who created the post has refused to comment ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u08-l05-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u08-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u8-interview","setting":"Une interview télévisée d’un homme politique.","speakers":[{"name":"Journalist","voice":"a"},{"name":"Hart","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Mr. Hart, a newspaper has accused your party of using public money for its campaign. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I completely deny that. Every dollar we spent was ours."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"But you admitted last week that the campaign had used government offices."},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I admitted using one office for one meeting. That's very different."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Will you publish the campaign accounts?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I refuse to answer questions based on rumors. I insist that we haven't done anything wrong."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe."}]},"question":"Que laisse entendre la journaliste avec son dernier commentaire ?","options":["Que beaucoup de gens ne vont pas croire Hart","Que Hart a raison","Que l’interview s’est bien terminée","Que le public ne la regardait pas"]},"answer":"Que beaucoup de gens ne vont pas croire Hart","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La journaliste dit : « Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u08-l05-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u08-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The program has a large audience.","options":["The program has a large audience.","The program has a small audience.","The program had a large audience.","The concert has a large audience."]},"answer":"The program has a large audience.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-audience"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u08-l05-e08","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u08-l05","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Remets les mots dans l’ordre","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["She","suggested","checking","the","official","website"],"translation":"Elle a suggéré de consulter le site officiel."},"answer":"She suggested checking the official website.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["efr-suggest"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u08-l05-e09","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u08-l05","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Réponds en anglais","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"What did the post claim? (que le parc allait fermer)","translation":"Qu’affirmait la publication ?"},"answer":"It claimed that the park was going to close.","accepted_answers":["It claimed that the park would close