éo ?"},"answer":"Because it went viral.","accepted_answers":["It went viral.","Because it has gone viral.","Because it's gone viral."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["efr-go-viral"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e01","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":1,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I had studied, I would have ___ the exam.","translation":"Si j’avais étudié, j’aurais réussi l’examen.","options":["passed","pass","passing","to pass"]},"answer":"passed","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Would have + participe (passed).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e02","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I ___ listened to my teacher, I would have studied science.","translation":"Si j’avais écouté ma prof, j’aurais fait des études de sciences.","options":["had","have","would","did"]},"answer":"had","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Après if, on met le past perfect (had + participe), jamais would : comme en français, où l’on ne dit pas « si j’aurais ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e03","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I hadn't left, I ___ have started my business.","translation":"Si je n’étais pas parti, je n’aurais pas créé mon entreprise.","options":["wouldn't","won't","didn't","hadn't"]},"answer":"wouldn't","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e04","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u9-reunion","setting":"Deux anciens camarades de lycée se retrouvent vingt ans après.","speakers":[{"name":"Paul","voice":"a"},{"name":"Clara","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Twenty years! Do you ever look back on our school days?"},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"All the time. If I had listened to Mrs. Gray, I would have studied science. I loved it, but I was too lazy."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"You weren't lazy. You just had a lot going on at home."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Maybe. And you? You were always the best at math."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"I dropped out of university in my second year. If I hadn't, I would have become an engineer."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Sometimes. If only I had asked for help when I was struggling. But if I hadn't left, I wouldn't have started my business. So I'm not sure."}]},"question":"Qu’est-ce que Clara aurait étudié si elle avait écouté sa prof ?","options":["Les sciences","Les maths","L’ingénierie","La gestion"]},"answer":"Les sciences","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Clara dit : « If I had listened to Mrs. Gray, I would have studied science ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u9-reunion","setting":"Deux anciens camarades de lycée se retrouvent vingt ans après.","speakers":[{"name":"Paul","voice":"a"},{"name":"Clara","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Twenty years! Do you ever look back on our school days?"},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"All the time. If I had listened to Mrs. Gray, I would have studied science. I loved it, but I was too lazy."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"You weren't lazy. You just had a lot going on at home."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Maybe. And you? You were always the best at math."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"I dropped out of university in my second year. If I hadn't, I would have become an engineer."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Sometimes. If only I had asked for help when I was struggling. But if I hadn't left, I wouldn't have started my business. So I'm not sure."}]},"question":"Pourquoi Paul n’est-il pas sûr d’avoir des regrets ?","options":["Parce que s’il n’avait pas quitté la fac, il n’aurait pas créé son entreprise","Parce qu’il n’aimait pas l’ingénierie","Parce qu’il n’a jamais eu de difficultés","Parce que Clara l’a convaincu"]},"answer":"Parce que s’il n’avait pas quitté la fac, il n’aurait pas créé son entreprise","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paul dit : « But if I hadn’t left, I wouldn’t have started my business. So I’m not sure ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"If I had studied, I would have passed the exam.","options":["If I had studied, I would have passed the exam.","If I study, I will pass the exam.","If I had studied, I would pass the exam.","If I had slept, I would have passed the exam."]},"answer":"If I had studied, I would have passed the exam.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Remets les mots dans l’ordre","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["If","we","had","left","earlier","we","would","have","caught","the","train"],"translation":"Si nous étions partis plus tôt, nous aurions eu le train."},"answer":"If we had left earlier we would have caught the train.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e08","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Réponds en anglais","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why did you fail the test? (si tu avais étudié, tu aurais réussi)","translation":"Pourquoi tu as raté le contrôle ?"},"answer":"If I had studied, I would have passed.","accepted_answers":["If I'd studied, I would have passed.","If I had studied, I'd have passed.","If I had studied more, I would have passed."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l01-e09","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l01","position":9,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduis en anglais","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Si j’avais étudié, j’aurais réussi l’examen."},"answer":"If I had studied, I would have passed the exam.","accepted_answers":["If I'd studied, I would have passed the exam.","If I had studied I would have passed the exam.","If I had studied, I'd have passed the exam.","I would have passed the exam if I had studied."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l02-e01","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l02","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Associe chaque mot à sa signification","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"if only","right":"si seulement"},{"left":"look back on","right":"repenser à / se remémorer (une époque)"},{"left":"struggle","right":"avoir du mal / avoir des difficultés"},{"left":"drop out","right":"abandonner (ses études)"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["efr-if-only","efr-look-back-on","efr-struggle","efr-drop-out"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l02-e02","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l02","position":2