e."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Maybe. And you? You were always the best at math."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"I dropped out of university in my second year. If I hadn't, I would have become an engineer."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Sometimes. If only I had asked for help when I was struggling. But if I hadn't left, I wouldn't have started my business. So I'm not sure."}]},"question":"Que regrette Paul ?","options":["De ne pas avoir demandé de l’aide quand il avait des difficultés","D’avoir étudié l’ingénierie","D’avoir créé une entreprise","De ne pas être allé à la réunion"]},"answer":"De ne pas avoir demandé de l’aide quand il avait des difficultés","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paul dit : « If only I had asked for help when I was struggling ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l02-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u9-reunion","setting":"Deux anciens camarades de lycée se retrouvent vingt ans après.","speakers":[{"name":"Paul","voice":"a"},{"name":"Clara","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Twenty years! Do you ever look back on our school days?"},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"All the time. If I had listened to Mrs. Gray, I would have studied science. I loved it, but I was too lazy."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"You weren't lazy. You just had a lot going on at home."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Maybe. And you? You were always the best at math."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"I dropped out of university in my second year. If I hadn't, I would have become an engineer."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Sometimes. If only I had asked for help when I was struggling. But if I hadn't left, I wouldn't have started my business. So I'm not sure."}]},"question":