 mentalité fixe » quand elles ont du mal ?","options":["Qu’elles ne sont tout simplement pas douées pour ça","Qu’elles doivent s’entraîner plus","Que le prof est mauvais","Que c’est une question de temps"]},"answer":"Qu’elles ne sont tout simplement pas douées pour ça","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article dit : « When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\" ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l03-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Un article de vulgarisation sur la mentalité de croissance.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"Pour quelqu’un qui a une « mentalité de croissance », qu’est-ce qu’une erreur ?","options":["Une information qui montre ce qu’il faut travailler ensuite","Un échec","Une raison d’abandonner","Quelque chose qu’il faut cacher"]},"answer":"Une information qui montre ce qu’il faut travailler ensuite","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article dit : « a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l03-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Un article de vulgarisation sur la mentalité de croissance.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"Qu’est-ce qui aide les élèves à rester motivés plus longtemps ?","options":["Voir leurs propres progrès","Avoir de bonnes notes","Avoir du talent","Étudier seuls"]},"answer":"Voir leurs propres progrès","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article dit : « students who see their progress stay motivated for longer ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l03-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l03","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Motivation comes and goes.","options":["Motivation comes and goes.","Motivation comes and stays.","Motivation goes and comes back.","Money comes and goes."]},"answer":"Motivation comes and goes.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-motivation"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l03-e08","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l03","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prom