-u09-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Un étudiant parle avec une conseillère pédagogique de l’université.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"Qu’est-ce qu’Ivan aurait fait autrement s’il avait connu la bourse plus tôt ?","options":["Il n’aurait pas pris autant de services au travail","Il ne se serait pas inscrit","Il aurait changé de travail","Il aurait quitté la fac plus tôt"]},"answer":"Il n’aurait pas pris autant de services au travail","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ivan dit : « If I’d known about it earlier, I wouldn’t have taken so many shifts ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u09-l05-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u09-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Un article de blog sur comment arrêter de procrastiner.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":[