nth?"}]},"question":"Qu’est-ce que Nora a pensé du roman ?","options":["Elle ne pouvait pas s’arrêter de le lire ; elle a trouvé l’intrigue très astucieuse","Elle l’a trouvé ennuyeux","Elle ne l’a pas fini","Elle n’a aimé que la fin"]},"answer":"Elle ne pouvait pas s’arrêter de le lire ; elle a trouvé l’intrigue très astucieuse","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nora dit : « I couldn’t stop reading. The plot is so clever ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u11-l01-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u11-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u11-book-club","setting":"Deux amies parlent d’un roman dans leur club de lecture.","speakers":[{"name":"Julia","voice":"a"},{"name":"Nora","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Julia","text":"So, did you finish the novel?"},{"speaker":"Nora","text":"Last night. I couldn't stop reading. The plot is so clever."},{"speaker":"Julia","text":"I know! And that twist in the last chapter… I didn't see it coming at all."},{"speaker":"Nora","text":"Neither did I. It turns out that the narrator was lying to us from the start."},{"speaker":"Julia","text":"Exactly. Looking back, the clues were all there, but I trusted her completely."},{"speaker":"Nora","text":"My favorite character was the old fisherman, though. He hardly says anything, but every word matters."},{"speaker":"Julia","text":"Same here. Shall we choose another book by her for next month?"}]},"question":"Quel personnage Nora préfère-t-elle, et pourquoi ?","options":["Le vieux pêcheur : il ne parle presque pas, mais chaque mot compte","La narratrice, parce qu’elle est sincère","Le héros, parce qu’il est courageux","Aucun"]},"answer":"Le vieux pêcheur : il ne parle presque pas, mais chaque mot compte","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nora dit : « My favorite character was the old fisherman… He hardly sa