3-e02","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u11-l03","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"___ past the old lighthouse, she noticed a light.","translation":"En passant devant le vieux phare, elle a vu une lumière.","options":["Walking","Walked","Walk","To walk"]},"answer":"Walking","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Participe en -ing : deux actions en même temps, du même sujet (comme le gérondif « en …-ant »).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-narrator"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u11-l03-e03","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u11-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"When she heard the news, she burst into ___.","translation":"Quand elle a appris la nouvelle, elle a fondu en larmes.","options":["tears","cry","crying","sad"]},"answer":"tears","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-burst-into-tears"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u11-l03-e04","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u11-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Un grand-père raconte à sa petite-fille comment il a rencontré sa grand-mère.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"Comment la grand-mère a-t-elle abordé le grand-père ?","options":["Sans prévenir, elle est venue l’inviter à danser","C’est lui qui l’a invitée à danser","Un ami les a présentés","Ils se sont rencontrés dans la rue"]},"answer":"Sans prévenir, elle est venue l’inviter à danser","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Le grand-père dit : « Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u11-l03-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u11-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Un grand-père raconte à sa petite-fille comment il a rencontré sa grand-mère.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"Qu’est-ce qui a brisé la glace ce soir-là ?","options":["Elle a ri quand il lui a marché sur le pied","Une blague du grand-père","Une chanson","Ils étaient voisins"]},"answer":"Elle a ri quand il lui a marché sur le pied","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Le grand-père dit : « She laughed, and that broke the ice ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u11-l03-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u11-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Un grand-père raconte à sa petite-fille comment il a rencontré sa grand-mère.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"Qu’est-il arrivé à la mère de la grand-mère au mariage ?","options":["Elle a fondu en larmes, de bonheur d’après le grand-père","Elle est partie tôt","Elle n’a pas voulu venir","Il a beaucoup ri"]},"answer":"Elle a fondu en larmes, de bonheur d’après le grand-père","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Le grand-père dit : « her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope! ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u11-l03-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u11-l03","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"My old friend called me 