":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I ___ braver, I would have said yes.","translation":"Si j’étais plus courageux, j’aurais dit oui.","options":["were","am","would be","will be"]},"answer":"were","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mixte : présent différent (if I were) → résultat passé (would have said).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-would-have"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l02-e03","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l02","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I'm having second ___ about the trip.","translation":"J’ai des doutes sur le voyage.","options":["thoughts","ideas","minds","feelings"]},"answer":"thoughts","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-have-second-thoughts"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l02-e04","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l02","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u12-job-offer","setting":"Une amie raconte à une autre qu’elle doit décider si elle déménage pour le travail.","speakers":[{"name":"Alice","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rosa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},