ranslation":"Essaie de trouver un terrain d’entente.","options":["ground","point","place","side"]},"answer":"ground","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-common-ground"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l03-e03","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complète la phrase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I don't want to take ___ in their argument.","translation":"Je ne veux pas prendre parti dans leur dispute.","options":["sides","part","place","care"]},"answer":"sides","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-take-sides"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l03-e04","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Une annonce d’un service de médiation entre voisins.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"Que font les médiateurs, d’après l’annonce ?","options":["Ils aident les deux personnes à s’écouter et à trouver un terrain d’entente","Ils décident qui a raison","Ils appellent la police","Ils mettent une amende"]},"answer":"Ils aident les deux personnes à s’écouter et à trouver un terrain d’entente","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’annonce dit : « Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l03-e05","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Une réunion d’équipe tendue avant la présentation d’un projet.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Quel est le conflit entre le design et les ventes ?","options":["Les ventes veulent changer le design deux jours avant le lancement","Le design ne veut pas travailler le week-end","Les ventes ont perdu un client","Personne ne veut faire le projet"]},"answer":"Les ventes veulent changer le design deux jours avant le lancement","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Leo dit : « The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l03-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l03","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce 