l est gratuit et confidentiel","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’annonce dit : « Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l05-e06","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Une annonce d’un service de médiation entre voisins.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"Que promet le service au sujet de tes informations ?","options":["Qu’il ne les partagera jamais avec l’autre personne sans ton accord","Qu’il les affiche au centre social","Qu’il les partage avec la police","Qu’il les efface au bout d’une semaine"]},"answer":"Qu’il ne les partagera jamais avec l’autre personne sans ton accord","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’annonce dit : « Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l05-e07","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l05","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Une réunion d’équipe tendue avant la présentation d’un projet.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Que veut dire la responsable avec « Only then can we finish on time » ?","options":["Que ce n’est qu’avec cet accord qu’ils pourront finir à temps","Qu’ils vont finir en retard de toute façon","Que c’est le client qui décide de la date","Qu’il faut tout recommencer"]},"answer":"Que ce n’est qu’avec cet accord qu’ils pourront finir à temps","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Only then + auxiliaire + sujet : c’est seulement s’ils font ce qu’elle a proposé qu’ils pourront finir à temps.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l05-e08","lesson_id":"efr-b2-u12-l05","position":8,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Écoute et choisis ce que tu entends","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Only then can we finish on time.","options":["Only then can we finish on time.","Only then can we start on time.","Only then we can finish on time.","Even then we can finish on time."]},"answer":"Only then can we finish on time.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["efr-only-then"]},{"id":"efr-b2-u12-l05-e09","lesson_id":"e