ank","sentence":"We will sign, provided that the price ___ the same.","translation":"Nous signerons, à condition que le prix reste le même.","options":["stays","will stay","stayed","would stay"]},"answer":"stays","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Après provided that (comme après if), on met le présent, même quand on parle du futur.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.kbhzgwpy14c2kk","content_hash":"v1:e4aaa5ac4fd0a27d6d744fda862823850dd43100a65ae7472271fecaf0c53d95","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u2-offer","document":"email","setting":"Une candidate répond à une offre d’emploi.","from":"Laura Kim","to":"Mr. Patel","title":"Job offer","lines":["Dear Mr. Patel,","Thank you very much for the job offer. I am very excited about joining the team.","Before I accept, I would like to discuss one point. In my current job I work from home two days a week, and this flexibility is important to me.","I would be happy to accept a slightly lower salary, provided that I can keep those two days at home. Otherwise, I am afraid I would have to turn the offer down.","I hope we can reach an agreement. I am free to talk at any time this week.","Kind regards,","Laura Kim"]},"question":"Quelle condition Laura pose-t-elle pour accepter l’offre ?","options":["Continuer à télétravailler deux jours par semaine","Un salaire plus élevé","Commencer le mois prochain","Avoir sa propre équipe"]},"answer":"Continuer à télétravailler deux jours par semaine","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Laura écrit : « I would be happy to accept a slightly lower salary, provided that I can keep those two days at home ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.vkbt4wsk39d9ff","content_has