ory.","Friends fall out all the time. What matters is how you make up. — Ruth"]},"question":"Quel est l’avis de Ruth ?","options":["Elles ont toutes les deux eu tort : arriver en retard était impoli, mais Lina a exagéré","Seule l’amie a eu tort","Seule Lina a eu tort","Aucune n’a eu tort"]},"answer":"Elles ont toutes les deux eu tort : arriver en retard était impoli, mais Lina a exagéré","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ruth répond : « you both made mistakes… you probably overreacted when you shouted at her in public ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.kxz0r5pdv06fql","content_hash":"v1:bb1fb9edbeb5819a981ecea288522db01b416ad63c08eef5f7e2cf1ef993b0b0","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u6-advice","document":"post","setting":"Un courrier des lecteurs : la lettre d’une lectrice et la réponse.","title":"Ask Ruth","lines":["Dear Ruth, Last week I fell out with my best friend. She was an hour late for my birthday dinner, and I shouted at her in front of everyone. Now I feel guilty, but I am also still a bit angry. What should I do? — Lina","Dear Lina, It sounds like you both made mistakes. Being an hour late is rude, and you had every right to be upset. However, you probably overreacted when you shouted at her in public.","Try not to take it personally. She could have had a good reason for being late. Call her, tell her how you felt, and listen to her side of the story.","Friends fall out all the time. What matters is how you make up. — Ruth"]},"question":"Selon Ruth, qu’est-ce qui compte le plus ?","options":["La façon de se réconcilier, parce que les amis se disputent tout le temps","Ne jamais se disputer","Savoir qui a raison","Que l’amie s’excuse en premier"]},"answer":"La façon de se réconcilier, parce que les amis se disputent tout le temps","accepted_answers"