u58m6i9bd","content_hash":"v1:b9b8e4f8c2b323515d4aa3956510fafcb6a33569615caa125c0bed01d07ce228","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u7-drought","setting":"Un reportage radio sur la sécheresse dans une région agricole.","speakers":[{"name":"Presenter","voice":"a"},{"name":"Paula","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"We go now to Paula, who is in the south, where there hasn't been any real rain for eight months."},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Thanks. This is the worst drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"How are farmers dealing with it?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"With great difficulty. Even though they have reduced their water use, many have lost half of their crops. And there is now a water shortage in three towns."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Is this connected to global warming?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Scientists say yes. Ironically, two years ago this same region suffered terrible floods. Extreme weather, in both directions, is a direct consequence of a warmer planet."}]},"question":"Pourquoi les rivières sont-elles toujours basses ?","options":["Parce que les orages de la semaine dernière n’ont pas suffi après huit mois sans pluie","Parce que les agriculteurs utilisent trop d’eau","Parce qu’il y a eu des inondations","Parce qu’on a fermé un barrage"]},"answer":"Parce que les orages de la semaine dernière n’ont pas suffi après huit mois sans pluie","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paula dit : « This is the worst drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.mgub846ajducf4","content_hash":"v1:426082bf05977dc1fc33174d7fc926cc95a818389219b1e14ab22ecfb4a33aa7","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u7-drought","setting":"Un reportage radio sur la sécheresse dans une région agricole.","speakers":[{"name":"Presenter","voice":"a"},{"name":"Paula","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"We go now to Paula, who is in the south, where there hasn't been any real rain for eight months."},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Thanks. This is the worst drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"How are farmers dealing with it?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"With great difficulty. Even though they have reduced their water use, many have lost half of their crops. And there is now a water shortage in three towns."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Is this connected to global warming?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Scientists say yes. Ironically, two years ago this same region suffered terrible floods. Extreme weather, in both directions, is a direct consequence of a warmer planet."}]},"question":"Qu’est-ce que la situation a d’ironique, selon Paula ?","options":["Qu’il y a deux ans, la même région a subi de terribles inondations","Qu’il n’avait jamais autant plu","Que les agriculteurs ont gagné plus","Que les scientifiques ne connaissent pas la cause"]},"answer":"Qu’il y a deux ans, la même région a subi de terribles inondations","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paula dit : « Ironically, two years ago this same region suffered terrible floods ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.hdsx4wr19psmw2","content_hash":"v1:0e46b38464fb76ba409ab1eb032b41eaa8bbfc3ce8b250cc27b743b4b353c575","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u7-report","document":"notice","setting":"Le résumé du rapport d’une organisa