:null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.2nq1k91nhr6pem","content_hash":"v1:770d9a388d2ce406b1538764e184f758335cccef941dcd2fce62ac3a16e67e5f","prompt_es":"Lis et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"efr.stim.b2-u7-footprint","document":"post","setting":"Une tribune sur l’empreinte carbone.","title":"Your shower will not save the planet","lines":["We are constantly told to reduce our carbon footprint: take shorter showers, eat less meat, fly less. These things matter, but they are not enough.","Just one hundred companies are responsible for most of the world’s emissions. Whereas a single family can save a few tons of CO2 a year, one large factory can produce millions.","This does not mean that individual action is useless. Even if your own impact is small, your choices send a message to companies and governments.","The real solution is a fast move to renewable energy, such as solar and wind. Only governments can make that happen, and only if we vote for it."]},"question":"Quelle est la vraie solution, selon l’auteur ?","options":["Passer vite aux énergies renouvelables, ce que seuls les gouvernements peuvent faire","Que chaque famille prenne des douches courtes","Fermer toutes les usines","Arrêter de voter"]},"answer":"Passer vite aux énergies renouvelables, ce que seuls les gouvernements peuvent faire","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’article dit : « The real solution is a fast move to renewable energy… Only governments can make that happen ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.6c032a5djovvaf","content_hash":"v1:f7df8bbba35021ebbddea8338837b8c5e7eec77811d96265efbb9913a4924051","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u7-students","setting":"Deux étudiants débattent : une seule personne peut-elle aider la planète ?","speakers":[{"name":"Noah","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mia","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I've stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"That's great, but honestly, it won't change anything. Even if everyone in this city stopped flying, it would be a tiny difference."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I don't agree. Big changes always start with small groups of people."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"Maybe. But we need to tackle the real causes: coal, oil, and the way we produce food."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"Sure, but those things change when people demand something different."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"OK, that's a fair point. So we both want a sustainable future. We just disagree about how to get there."}]},"question":"Sur quoi Noah et Mia finissent-ils par être d’accord ?","options":["Ils veulent tous les deux un avenir durable, mais pas de la même façon","Ils vont tous les deux arrêter de prendre l’avion","Ils ne sont d’accord sur rien","Mia admet qu’une seule personne peut tout changer"]},"answer":"Ils veulent tous les deux un avenir durable, mais pas de la même façon","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mia dit : « So we both want a sustainable future. We just disagree about how to get there ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.hsqicg3n8frl24","content_hash":"v1:5886d9d0f54f5c76cb3a05993d6c8559184ed8eef84f76df8f8d627ff0864cb8","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u7-students","setting":"Deux étudiants débattent : une seule personne peut-elle aider la planète ?","speakers":[{"name":"Noah","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mia","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I've stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"