es deux personnes à s’écouter et à trouver un terrain d’entente","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"L’annonce dit : « Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground ».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"efr.ex.ytx5n2a5t1tyql","content_hash":"v1:5130791467dbb6c40b41f3a2311a028d96729648f295a11b5241a2332c1cbb4c","prompt_es":"Écoute et réponds","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"efr.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Une réunion d’équipe tendue avant la présentation d’un projet.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"Quel est le conflit entre le design et les ventes ?","options":["Les ventes veulent changer le design deux jours avant le lancement","Le design ne veut pas travailler le week-end","Les ventes ont perdu un client","Personne ne veut faire le projet"]},"answer":"Les ventes veulent changer le design deux jours avant le lancement","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Leo dit : « The sales team w